# Live-capture sidecars are per-run artifacts written by the parent harness
# (phase-9-harness/tools/run_interop_cell.py write_inrepo_golden). Only the
# committed reference golden (<cell>.fix) is tracked; diff_golden_or_skip
# compares the committed golden against this freshly-captured sidecar. On a
# checkout with no paired live run, the sidecar is absent and the gated cell
# skips ("capture sidecar absent") — the intended skip-without-counterparty path.
*-capture.fix
